<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
    Notification icon.

    Status-bar icons are drawn as a mask: only the alpha channel is used, the colour comes from the
    system. So this is a solid white glyph on a transparent background, and it must be a simple
    silhouette — small details disappear at 24dp.

    The shape is a prompt chevron followed by a cursor block: the app is a shell agent, and the
    glyph reads at status-bar size where a full terminal window would turn into a smudge.
-->
